   "The out-of-pocket ceiling applies per medical institution and separately for inpatient and outpatient care, so using more than one medical institution can bring the total above 10,000 yen.",
   "Only medical care related to the certified specified disease is covered; medical costs for other illnesses and costs outside insurance coverage (extra charges for a private room, meal charges, and similar) are paid separately.",
   "The 20,000 yen treatment applies only to dialysis patients under 70 whose income is above a set level.",
   "Some municipalities issue the certificate on the same day, so checking at the counter is the surest way."
