   "Many municipalities require application before the birth, and the period during which application is possible also differs by municipality, so consulting early once the pregnancy is known is necessary.",
   "The income standards for eligibility and the amount of the user contribution differ by municipality.",
   "Some municipalities exclude cases where the lump-sum childbirth allowance and similar payments from health insurance reach a certain amount.",
   "At the consultation, information about other childbirth and childrearing support systems may also be provided."
