   "The Disability Basic Pension for an injury or illness arising before age 20 is subject to suspension based on income (for a person with no dependent relatives, payment is fully suspended if the previous year's income exceeds 4,794,000 yen and half is suspended if it exceeds 3,761,000 yen; 380,000 yen and other amounts are added for each dependent relative). The judgment based on the previous year's income applies to the months from October (10月) of that year through September (9月) of the following year, and the threshold amounts may be revised, so the latest figures need to be checked at a pension office",
