   "Have a physician prepare the medical certificate on the prescribed form",
   "Submit the certification claim form, medical certificate and other documents to the municipal counter",
   "The prefecture or designated city reviews the degree of disability and the income",
   "Once certified, payment starts from the month following the month of the certification claim"
