   "It is not paid when the child can receive a public pension granted on the ground of the disability, when the child is admitted to a residential facility for children with disabilities or similar institution, or when the child or the eligible person does not have an address in Japan",
   "Grade 1 or grade 2 is certified on the basis of the prescribed medical certificate, separately from whether a disability certificate is held and from its grade",
