  "short": "A single nationwide number that connects to the nearest domestic violence consultation desk",
  "target": "People troubled by violence from a spouse, a partner, or a dating partner. This is not limited to physical violence and includes psychological, economic, and sexual violence. The line can be used regardless of gender",
  "benefit": "When #8008 is dialed, the call is automatically routed, based on the location it is placed from, to the nearest Spousal Violence Counseling and Support Center or similar consultation desk, where a trained counselor responds. Anonymous consultation is also possible",
