   "Check the eligibility, rates, and application deadline on the municipality's website or at its desk",
   "Gather the necessary documents",
   "Submit the reduction application by the deadline (deadlines differ by reason: by the payment deadline in some cases, within 30 days from the day after the disaster has subsided for disasters, or by June 30 for hardship-based reductions, for example)",
   "Check the notice of the decision",
   "If the reduction is not granted, discuss a grace period or payment in installments at the desk"
