  "benefit": "The national government and local public bodies support all or part of the expenses borne by guardians (no repayment required). The expenses listed as covered include transport costs (commuting), school trip costs, school supplies, and dormitory costs. The items covered and the amounts differ according to the income category of the guardians and by local government.",
